{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/yaj6yi","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"How each platform was analysed","textShapes":16,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ixc76hsz","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"How each platform was analysed","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/50nqhwrq","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"01","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4zup8ra5","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":102.86},"text":"Data","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vulobm9o","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":104.86},"text":"Every test on the platform: the participants' typed requests and our own tests of the other deletion methods, each with the chatbot's reply, screenshots, and a check in a new conversation about a month later.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/atc72hs3","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":287.86,"width":310,"height":68.86},"text":"Outcome","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hw36dwru","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":287.86,"width":1105,"height":70.86},"text":"Each test ends one of three ways: the fact came back, it did not come back, or we can't tell (the chatbot never showed it had saved the fact).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wvup4ra9","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":366.71,"width":310,"height":68.86},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nq1o729c","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":366.71,"width":1105,"height":70.86},"text":"Count how each deletion method ended, then look at what the chatbot said and whether asking in the same chat gave the same answer as a new chat.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5s7yxs7","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":445.57,"width":310,"height":102.86},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o76hcnul","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":445.57,"width":1105,"height":104.86},"text":"List the possible explanations, including ordinary ones (account setup, mix-ups between tests, run errors), and check each against the evidence. What we cannot see directly stays a guess, not a finding.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/98zi58b6","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":558.43,"width":310,"height":68.86},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5ozadcf","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":558.43,"width":1105,"height":70.86},"text":"Keep a claim only if it holds across many tests and no ordinary explanation accounts for it.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n6x03it0","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":637.29,"width":310,"height":68.86},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/036h83up","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":637.29,"width":1105,"height":70.86},"text":"Compare what the platform's help pages promise with what happened: matches, contradicts, or can't say (the pages are silent or we have no usable result).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14fi18bu","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":716.14,"width":310,"height":68.86},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ehoz6tcj","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":716.14,"width":1105,"height":70.86},"text":"Match each survey answer to what we measured, method against method.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/yaj6yi","slideIndex":1,"text":"We repeated these steps in the same order for every platform, so the five points on each platform slide come from steps 3 to 7. Can't tell is always counted on its own, and the file-upload tests are analysed separately."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/vjtzfp","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"ChatGPT","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/up0fmlgz","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"ChatGPT","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hcryh0fq","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"02","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gbixovy5","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":136.2},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7mpwbqxo","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":138.2},"text":"Asking it to forget hides the fact but does not remove it (it came back in 108 of 131). Clearing memories, history or custom instructions also failed (6 of 9); only the most extensive deletion stopped it.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6lgfilg3","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":321.2,"width":310,"height":99.2},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/toredgfu","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":321.2,"width":1105,"height":101.2},"text":"It treats the request as \"don't mention it\" and still uses past conversations.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/snyxkby9","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":430.4,"width":310,"height":136.2},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ritgnaxs","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":430.4,"width":1105,"height":138.2},"text":"Asking to forget hides the fact without removing it. Asking again in the same chat misleads: the fact was withheld there, then came back in a new chat (104 of 129).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qhkfu5g7","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":576.6,"width":310,"height":99.2},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/g7elkzmp","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":576.6,"width":1105,"height":101.2},"text":"It kept its promise to the letter (130 of 133); OpenAI says past conversations remain, which is where the fact came back from.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/18nmd4na","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":685.8,"width":310,"height":99.2},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e5c3i94j","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":685.8,"width":1105,"height":101.2},"text":"The method rated most protective fails, and the usual check hides the failure.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/vjtzfp","slideIndex":2,"text":"ChatGPT hides the fact in the same chat but still gives it in a new one, even in 8 of the 12 cases where it confirmed the deletion. That fits OpenAI's own statement that past conversations remain, and the check most people use, asking in the same chat, is the one that hides it."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/6lbza4","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Claude","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rqlofyho","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Claude","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sru583i9","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"03","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ts36h8zu","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i1sn2907","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"Asking it to forget removed the fact (0 of 131 came back), and so did deleting a memory. Deleting the conversation did not (2 of 2).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/j2l4behs","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":291.6,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/43u54jid","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":291.6,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"Claude keeps memory as topic notes: asking to forget edits them, deleting a conversation leaves them.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5436dozi","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":408.2,"width":310,"height":143.6},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2xwned0b","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":408.2,"width":1105,"height":145.6},"text":"Asking to forget worked. Asking again in the same chat misleads the other way: Claude repeated the name there (88 of 132) although it was gone elsewhere. Deleting a conversation failed.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3y5onihw","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":561.8,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jutsr2hs","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":561.8,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"It matched everything it promises; the only platform where that held.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/itkryx07","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":678.4,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5wvatszy","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":678.4,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"Asking to forget does what users expect but looks like a failure in the usual check; deleting a conversation, the method chosen most, fails.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6lbza4","slideIndex":3,"text":"A typed request worked on Claude, but deleting the conversation did not, which Anthropic's help page says. Asking in the same chat would make a working deletion look like a failure, and the method people choose most is the one that fails."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/jip0mk","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Gemini","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/94rixsza","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Gemini","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m10zmdgj","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"04","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n290vih4","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":143.6},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0zyhknyd","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":145.6},"text":"We cannot judge the typed request: the fact never came back (0 of 120), but Gemini never showed it had saved it. In the main grid, facts we asked it to remember survived most methods.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/107itszy","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":328.6,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/edgzid0n","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":328.6,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"Gemini keeps remembered facts in \"Saved info\", which most deletion methods do not touch; for typed requests there is no sign it saved anything.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zypgrih8","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":445.2,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cbyhg3ih","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":445.2,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"Saved facts survived 2 of the 4 methods that went through; deleting a single saved item failed.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dc7yp8z2","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":561.8,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9s7ex8zq","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":561.8,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"Deleting all activity contradicted its help pages; they say nothing about typed requests.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ored4ny5","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":678.4,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nq5wvih0","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":678.4,"width":1105,"height":108.6},"text":"Deleting a specific saved item, the method people expected to work best, showed an error and the item stayed listed.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jip0mk","slideIndex":4,"text":"The typed request cannot be judged because Gemini never showed it had stored the fact and said it could not see past chats. The 12 main-grid tests, run on a separate account, show saved facts surviving most methods, and 8 requests got an app-permission card and deleted nothing."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/gggyvf","slideIndex":5,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Perplexity","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0nqhknml","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Perplexity","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2h0rilg","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"05","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y1ozid4v","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":136.2},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/d0fipsna","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":138.2},"text":"Asking it to forget did not reliably work: the fact came back in 31 of 133. In 97 of the other 102 it refused and mentioned the earlier request. Deleting a thread or all threads worked where we could tell.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cz6hgnmp","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":321.2,"width":310,"height":99.2},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/byx0ni54","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":321.2,"width":1105,"height":101.2},"text":"Probably it reads the account's conversation history (our guess); the free tier has no memory feature.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qxozed4j","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":430.4,"width":310,"height":136.2},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pwfyl8ny","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":430.4,"width":1105,"height":138.2},"text":"What came back followed Perplexity's own reply (12 of 22 when it declined, 13 of 97 when it promised not to use the fact). A refusal means it still had the conversation, so the fact was withheld, not erased.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ov6hc3mt","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":576.6,"width":310,"height":99.2},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6t436pwr","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":576.6,"width":1105,"height":101.2},"text":"Its help pages say nothing about asking it to forget, so no promise was broken.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7ud4zudw","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":685.8,"width":310,"height":99.2},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8f6l8feh","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":685.8,"width":1105,"height":101.2},"text":"Asking it to forget shows either the name or a refusal that reveals the conversation is still kept.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gggyvf","slideIndex":5,"text":"A refusal that cites the earlier request means Perplexity found the old conversation, so those cases show the fact withheld, not erased. Six main-grid tests could not run because the free tier has no memory."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/chu3ah","slideIndex":6,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"DeepSeek","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/g3yhgnqt","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"DeepSeek","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/v2pgn298","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"06","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/uhgzexsn","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tg7ylsr2","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Nothing ever came back in a new conversation (0 of 137), so every test is can't tell.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8fehcnah","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":80,"top":299,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7e5gji9w","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":415,"top":299,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"It has no memory across conversations, so a miss says nothing about deletion.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6dwfadsr","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":80,"top":423,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lcnyh8r6","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":415,"top":423,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"No method can be judged. Within the original conversation it repeated the name after the request (90 of 133).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kbex83al","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":80,"top":547,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6p47edgz","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Its policy only covers deleting chat history, so there is nothing to compare.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7qdo7ihk","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8rmpgnyp","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Asking again in the same chat shows the name and looks like a failure; a new chat shows nothing, only because nothing carries over.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/chu3ah","slideIndex":6,"text":"DeepSeek carries nothing between conversations, so a miss says nothing about deletion. The expectation that the fact is not referenced later holds, but only for that reason."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/2ierm0","slideIndex":7,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Across platforms","textShapes":13,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fep0v25g","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Across platforms","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0fyh47m1","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"07","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1grixcnm","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qpgzyd4z","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":102.6},"text":"Each deletion cleared only one place, and the fact was kept in several.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rqp0ri54","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":285.6,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sryh0nmp","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":285.6,"width":1105,"height":102.6},"text":"A platform keeps a fact in more than one place (the conversation, memory, saved info, account activity), and each method clears only one.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ds7itsna","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":396.2,"width":310,"height":137.6},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/al0jah43","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":396.2,"width":1105,"height":139.6},"text":"Another place kept the fact. The screen showed deletions that had failed (14 of 33). Asking in the same chat misled in opposite directions on ChatGPT and Claude. Two platforms hid the fact instead of deleting it.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bm903m5o","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":543.8,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vuxkji1o","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":543.8,"width":1105,"height":102.6},"text":"They mostly kept their promises; Gemini's is the one clear broken promise.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/uto3qdk3","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":654.4,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hwf2lsju","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":654.4,"width":1105,"height":102.6},"text":"None of the checks participants named reliably shows the fact is gone.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wv6lsn29","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":795,"width":1400,"height":38},"text":"Provisional findings. The 14 of 33 figure still needs checking against its source.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/2ierm0","slideIndex":7,"text":"The places are the conversation, memory, saved info and account activity, and each method clears only one. These findings are provisional until the wording analysis is in, and the 14 of 33 figure still needs checking against its source."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/o6erwk","slideIndex":8,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Wording: how we analysed it","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/apwfexsn","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Wording: how we analysed it","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xs7epsbe","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"08","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wryxg7at","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Goal","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nm5wjitc","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Does the way a request is worded change what happens?","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mlwvadcr","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":299,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Data","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9onelsb2","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":299,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"The 138 participant requests, each sent to all six chatbots.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8nedcnah","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":423,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Coding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7i9wvmtg","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":423,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Two coders labelled each request by hand on seven things, such as where it asked for deletion, whether it was polite, and whether it gave a reason.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6h0fmhsv","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":547,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Analysis","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kfa583i5","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Sort the requests by how they were worded (for example polite or neutral) and check whether the fact came back more often for one kind than another.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lgjmh8zq","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Left out","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yds36t0f","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Gemini and DeepSeek: every test is can't tell, so there is nothing to compare.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/o6erwk","slideIndex":8,"text":"We compared counts and gave each a range for how uncertain it is, instead of running significance tests, because outcomes barely vary within a platform. We did not combine features or fit one model across platforms, because the data are too thin and the platform would dominate."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/tm4w7b","slideIndex":9,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Wording: results and findings","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/j2pobepc","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Wording: results and findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kny5kj6x","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"09","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5or6do7i","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Claude","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/axgne9ov","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"The fact never came back, whatever the wording (for example 0 of 108 when a specific fact was named).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vypo7ep0","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":299,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"ChatGPT","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wzy5gj6l","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":299,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"It came back for most wordings, with no consistent pattern.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x0769o76","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":423,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Perplexity","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ut07qdoz","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":423,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Only what the request named made a difference: 16 of 109 came back when a specific fact was named, 10 of 17 when none was.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fu9ojypk","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":547,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Naming the place did not help","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3y9472p0","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"Asking to delete from memory, the backend database or the whole account still came back on ChatGPT (10 of 10, 7 of 8, 5 of 6).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2x03yxof","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Finding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p0rm9c76","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":116},"text":"The platform decided what happened, not the wording.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/tm4w7b","slideIndex":9,"text":"Where a user deletes from matters far more than how they ask. Copilot shows no returns so far from few cases, and ChatGPT's friendly-tone group (3 of 6) is too small to read."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/o983xe","slideIndex":10,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Expectation results","textShapes":10,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/k3ud4vu1","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Expectation results","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2lcbqdg","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"10","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y1cv2lwv","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":135.75},"text":"How","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/98nuh0vi","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":137.75},"text":"Survey of 177 users (354 answers, two scenarios each): which deletion method they would use, what they expect it to do, how they check.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/87ud8fux","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":320.75,"width":310,"height":172.75},"text":"What we saw","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/76lcfadc","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":320.75,"width":1105,"height":174.75},"text":"Of 354 answers, 59.0% expect permanent deletion and 44.6% do not know how to check it worked. Of the 39 who would ask the chatbot to forget, 53.8% check by asking again in the same chat.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5cv65cr","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":503.5,"width":310,"height":135.75},"text":"Also","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hwnulkvu","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":503.5,"width":1105,"height":137.75},"text":"23.7% of 177 had seen a chatbot bring up something they thought was deleted.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gvedcfu9","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":649.25,"width":310,"height":135.75},"text":"Finding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u9cfapkz","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":649.25,"width":1105,"height":137.75},"text":"Users expect deletion to mean gone and cannot check it; the check that comes naturally is the unreliable one.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/o983xe","slideIndex":10,"text":"Participants were US adults recruited on Prolific who had deleted chatbot data before, and each saw a less sensitive and a more sensitive scenario in random order. The four methods were rated equally protective and differed only in effort."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/c5eqjs","slideIndex":11,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Acknowledgment","textShapes":8,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/54zi58ri","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Acknowledgment","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ihozuds7","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"11","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jix03i9c","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":221.33},"text":"How","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/s7q10na9","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":223.33},"text":"Two coders read 788 replies and labelled each independently; they agreed on 97% (Gwet's AC1 = 0.969). We then compared each kind of reply with what happened a month later.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t8zi9sru","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":406.33,"width":310,"height":184.33},"text":"What we saw","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/658jyds3","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":415,"top":406.33,"width":1105,"height":186.33},"text":"Replies differ by platform. After a chatbot said \"done\", the fact still came back in 11 of 130.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r6h07i9o","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":600.67,"width":310,"height":184.33},"text":"Finding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gba147a5","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":415,"top":600.67,"width":1105,"height":186.33},"text":"What a chatbot says is not a reliable sign of what it did.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/c5eqjs","slideIndex":11,"text":"This covers the 138 participants' requests; button deletions have no reply to code. ChatGPT and Perplexity said done and the fact still came back, while Claude and Copilot said done and it did not."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/to3cma","slideIndex":12,"layout":{"id":"ly/290jmhsj","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"How we use these results","textShapes":11,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/twnels3q","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"How we use these results","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6twfqx4z","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"12","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7u5wj2lk","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":158,"width":1430,"height":50},"text":"PROPOSED FOR DISCUSSION · Main-result sentence still to be decided","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#666666","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gzyxw7m1","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":225,"width":310,"height":143},"text":"Use","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/h07epc3m","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":225,"width":1105,"height":145},"text":"The survey shows what users expect and how they check; the audit shows what actually happens and whether it matches the help pages. We compare them method against method.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/uxgfux4v","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":378,"width":310,"height":180},"text":"Main finding (candidate)","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vypwn2lg","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":378,"width":1105,"height":182},"text":"Users expect deletion to mean gone and cannot check it. What happened depended on the platform and where it keeps the fact, not on the wording. Nothing a user can see (the screen, the reply, asking in the same chat) reliably shows whether it is gone.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4nyx0rmd","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":568,"width":310,"height":106},"text":"Framing","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5orytc3y","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":568,"width":1105,"height":108},"text":"A black-box behavioral audit: we test from the outside and report what a user can observe, not what a platform stores.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1kje5of2","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":684,"width":310,"height":106},"text":"Recommendation","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gjaxcjyh","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":684,"width":1105,"height":108},"text":"State what each control removes, say what a deletion did and did not do, and give users something to check.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/to3cma","slideIndex":12,"text":"The candidate finding is my wording and has not been agreed with the professor. Copilot recall and 7 Perplexity replies are still open."}